      "difficulty_reason": "The author gives a computational interpolation theorem for five split-typing configurations, with explicit terms and contexts whose substitutions reduce to the original normal program. The tensor and applicative-context cases require coordinated interpolant types, continuations and beta/eta reductions. This term-level construction is not merely the formula-level interpolation conclusion stated again.",
